<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ansett says SIA not to take equity.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ansett says SIA not to take equity.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian airline Ansett on Friday denied speculation Singapore Airlines Ltd would take an equity stake in Ansett.</p>
<p>The two airlines are due to announce an alliance, based on code-sharing and cost-sharing arrangements, on Friday at about 0030 GMT (10.30 a.m. Australian time).</p>
<p>&quot;There's absolutely no equity tie-up,&quot; said Ansett public affairs manager Peter Young.</p>
